/*
 * Implements construction utilities for semantic Values.
 *
 * This module provides the low-level constructors used by the semantic
 * validator to build Values for:
 *
 *   - slice aliasing and slice construction,
 *   - enum unwrapping,
 *   - range unwrapping,
 *   - object instantiation,
 *   - method access on class instances,
 *   - atomic lock/unlock helpers,
 *   - panic-based bounds checks.
 *
 * These functions operate on already-validated Types and Values and are used
 * throughout the semantic validator to synthesize runtime constructs that
 * cannot be expressed directly in the syntax tree.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::create
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/create.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-26
